# Allow-list for tools/check_ninja_deps_orphans.py.
#
# An object may be listed here only when a zero-entry deps log cannot produce a
# translation-unit layout mismatch, i.e. when the source includes no project
# header at all. Every entry must state that evidence, because an object with
# "#deps 0" never rebuilds when a project header changes and that is how the
# editor_selection_picking_integration_tests Debug binary ended up linking a
# stale EditorController layout against a fresh desktop_scene_editor_ui one.
#
# tests/gpu_visibility_depth_model_tests.cpp includes exactly eight C++ standard
# headers (<algorithm>, <array>, <cmath>, <cstdint>, <initializer_list>,
# <iostream>, <limits>, <vector>) and no project header, and a clean rebuild of
# the single object reproduces "#deps 0", so the empty deps log is a property of
# the translation unit rather than lost dependency information.
CMakeFiles/gpu_visibility_depth_model_tests.dir/tests/gpu_visibility_depth_model_tests.cpp.obj
